      "problem": "$(-0.1)^{4}\\times (-0.1)^{8}=$",
      "worked_solution": "To multiply powers of the same base, we add the exponents:\n\n$$\n(-0.1)^{4}\\times (-0.1)^{8}=(-0.1)^{4+8}=(-0.1)^{12}\n$$",
